      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pellucid Grotto [zone=707]\n**Who:**\n- Kronk Kollus [npc=34050]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Cliknar Overseer [npc=35495]\n- a cliknar raider [npc=34051]\n- a cliknar thoughtstealer [npc=34052]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Kronk Kollus #2: A Delicate Matter [quest=4927]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 10 01:02:03 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Kronk Kollus in Pellucid Grotto. He's located at +100, +1326, +3._\n_This task is the first of two tasks given by Kronk Kollis._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kronk Kollus'\nKronk Kollus says 'Ah, strange one, I see you. I have seen you. I will see you again. All of Norrath lies before me, within my [view] below.'\nYou say, 'Your view?'\nKronk Kollus says 'Brell, in His wisdom, has appointed me as the Watcher of this place in the absence of Brell's true foreman. I stand watch, but it is a [troubled] watch.'\nYou say, 'Troubled?'\nKronk Kollus says 'Troubled, indeed, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! In this realm lie Brell's sacred thoughts, His very memories, stored in crystals of His own manufacture. Even as I watch, even as I oversee, shadowy agents of some foul master work to unravel the memories [stored] in the crystals.'\nYou say, 'Stored?'\nKut Kollus says 'Brell's mind is vast, his thoughts innumerable. He created the crystals to be bearers of his memories stretching back to the beginning of time. These memories must be [guarded]. If they become [compromised], Brell's ability to rely on them, and trust them, will be shattered. How will our god know himself if his memories, his core and crucial memories, are corrupted?'\nYou say, 'Guarded?'\nKronk Kollus says 'Ah, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, those are welcome tidings. Brell's memories are kept in crystal clusters near the pond in the northwest. We tend to them and try to keep them safe, but recently bands of Cliknar have been sneaking into our midst and damaging the crystals. If you would seek out and destroy these interlopers and secure the sanctity of Brell's thoughts, perhaps the balance of things may be restored in this area.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Many-Faceted Dilemma'.\nInspect the crystals in the northwest that hold Brell's memories, and defend the memories from any hostile forces. When you have completed this task, return to Kut Kollus.\n\n---\n\nExamine one of the memory crystals for damage 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Visit the crystal by the lake to the northwest of Kut Kollus. The next two steps open when you get to one._\n_Three cliknar spawn and rush your group, so be ready. They are aggro linked and cannot be split from one another. However, they are rootable/snareable, mezzable, and stunnable._\nKill 1 Cliknar raider 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nKill 2 Cliknar thoughtstealers 0/2 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Repeat again:_\nExamine one of the memory crystals for damage 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nKill 1 Cliknar raider 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nKill 2 Cliknar thoughtstealers 0/2 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_And again:_\nExamine one of the memory crystals for damage 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nKill 1 Cliknar raider 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nKill 2 Cliknar thoughtstealers 0/2 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_And once more (named this time):_\nExamine one of the memory crystals for damage 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nDestroy the Cliknar Overseer 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Reward:_\n105 platinum,\nYou gain experience!!\n**Submitted by:** Caudyr of Crusaders Valorous, Bertoxxulous",
