      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pellucid Grotto [zone=707]\n**Who:**\n- Magnite Ordinator Bammor [npc=34054]\nRating:\n0/3**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 3 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blue Finished Gem [item=86064]\n- Blue Unfinished Gem [item=85944]\n- Green Finished Gem [item=86065]\n- Green Unfinished Gem [item=85952]\n- Red Finished Gem [item=86102]\n- Red Unfinished Gem [item=85950]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Blar Gurin [npc=34212]\n- a magnite golem [npc=34255]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 10 01:21:35 2009\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Magnite Ordinator Bammor in Pellucid Grotto at location +100, +1314, +3._\nYou say, 'Hail, Magnite Ordinator Bammor'\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor says 'Dark times have fallen over us. Our once magnificent supply of gems here in the [Repository] is now slowly being depleted. To make matters worse, we are also experiencing an [issue] with the fire elementals as well as [sessiloids] depleting the nutrients in the soil.'\nYou say, 'The repository?'\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor says 'Aye, this is the Repository, and while many are no doubt unaware of this, this place is the metaphysical [source] of all gems which appear in Norrath.'\nYou say, 'Source?'\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor says 'Yes, this place is the source. However, I do not have time to explain this further to you, as the rapidly [depleting] supply of gems in the Repository requires my current attention now.'\nYou say, 'Depleting their supply?!'\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor says 'Thanks to the escape of the Primal Crystallines--creatures like the trichordonts, hulks, spheres, and exterminators--plus the civil war going on amongst the Crystalkins, there has not been any meaningful amount of gem-laying happening in the Repository. In this matter I wish to ask for your [assistance].'\nYou say, 'I'll give you my assistance'\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor says 'Thank you. Unfortunately we do not possess the ability to harvest the gems carried by the Primal Crystallines easily, so you will very likely need to destroy them and harvest their remains. Once you do this, have the Blar Gurin process the gems, and hand it to my worker magnite golems after processing. The Blar Gurin is a Sessiloid located in a passage to the north of Geodech, our city in the center of the grotto.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Filling the Repository'.\nMagnite Ordinator Bammor has tasked you with harvesting various unfinished gems from the Primal Crystallines--creatures like the trichordonts, hulks, spheres, and exterminators. After you collect the unfinished gems, have the Blar Gurin process the gems before giving them to the magnite golems to deposit. The Blar Gurin is a Sessiloid located in a passageway north of Geodech, the city in the center of the grotto.\n\n---\n\nLoot 3 Blue Unfinished Gem 0/3 (Pellucid Grotto)\nLoot 4 Red Unfinished Gem 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\nLoot 4 Green Unfinished Gem 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Blue gems are dropped by crystalline hulks. Red gems are dropped by crystalline trichordonts. Green gems are dropped by crystalline spheres and dischargers._\nFeed blue unfinished gems to the Blar Gurin to receive finished gems 0/3 (Pellucid Grotto)\nFeed red unfinished gems to the Blar Gurin to receive finished gems 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\nFeed green unfinished gems to the Blar Gurin to receive finished gems 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\nHand the blue finished gems to a magnite golem 0/3 (Pellucid Grotto)\nHand the red finished gems to a magnite golem 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\nHand the green finished gems to a magnite golem 0/4 (Pellucid Grotto)\nSpeak with Magnite Ordinator Bammor 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Rewards:_\n367 platinum, 5 gold,\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Caudyr of Crusaders Valorous, Bertoxxulous Server",
