them, and trust them, will be shattered. How will our god know himself if his memories, his core and crucial memories, are corrupted?'\nYou say, 'How are they compromised?'\nKronk Kollus says 'The Cliknar have already damaged the crystals. Several of Brell's memories have been corrupted, and there is no restoring them. What remains must be protected, but I fear the place where they are kept holds no shelter for the master's memory. They must be moved, yet I must not leave my watch. Another must rise to [protect] the memories.'\nYou say, 'Protect them?'\nKronk Kollus says 'One must not take this charge lightly, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. The memories of the master must be removed and transported to our city, Geodech, where they may be kept safe. This Lucidic Siphon has been created to draw Brell's memories out of the crystals, but unfortunately it can only hold one per trip. The siphon will provide safe transport to Geodech. Can I count on you to [help]?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Delicate Matter'.\n_You receive a \"Lucidic Siphon\"._\n\n---\n\nDraw Brell's Memories into the Lucidic Siphon 0/5 (Pellucid Grotto)\nDeliver Brell's Memories to Gol Kulnar 0/5 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Go to the place with the Memory Crystals (northwest corner). Hit or nuke a crystal until it reaches 35% or lower (mobs around shouldn't attack you) at which point you see..._\na memory crystal shimmers and fades as it begins to weaken\n_Click the Siphon while you have the crystal targetted, turning it into a Full Lucidic Siphon._\n_Go to Gol Kulnar and hail him (stay invisible). The Siphon turns into a Lucidic Siphon again. Repeat this four more times, then go back to Kronk._\n_Watch out for see invis mobs, particularly the crystalline hulks._\nReturn to Kronk Kollus 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\nGive the Lucidic Siphon to Kronk Kollus 0/1 (Pellucid Grotto)\n_Reward:_\nExperience\n_The task has a 6-hour lockout timer._",
